import ../../../editor/source_language.dl

set main to a UI source document named "main.dl" at "file:///workspace/main.dl" prefixed by "" containing "answer means: 42" using UI CPU analysis
set project to main's project
set client to a UI language client rooted at "file:///workspace"
set client's project to project
set client's model to the UI language model for main in client
set client's project context to project's context
set client's profiles to the compact JSON form of (project's profiles)
set work to the UI language opening in client
free work's payload

# Invalidate while didOpen is in flight, keeping the source bytes and context.
invalidate UI source project project
set response to a new JSON-RPC array
set work to the UI language reply response at step 4 in client
free response
free work's payload
set response to a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON number "id" is 6, JSON child "result" is (a JSON object containing [JSON child "data" is (a new JSON-RPC array)])]]
set work to the UI language reply response at step 6 in client
free response
require condition (main needs UI source analysis) reporting "A stale token reply completed a newer project generation"

loop attempt from 0 to 2:
    set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing main at 1.0 seconds
    require condition (work's step = 5) reporting "Project invalidation did not request a matching diagnostic snapshot"
    free work's payload
    set response to a new JSON-RPC array
    set work to the UI language reply response at step 5 in client
    free response
    free work's payload
    set response to a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON number "id" is 6, JSON child "result" is (a JSON object containing [JSON child "data" is (a new JSON-RPC array)])]]
    set work to the UI language reply response at step 6 in client
    free response
    require condition ((main needs UI source analysis) = false) reporting "The replacement diagnostic snapshot did not complete"
    require condition (project's report revision = project's revision) reporting "Diagnostics belong to an old project generation"
    if attempt = 0:
        invalidate UI source project project

# Secondary documents share the main document's completed diagnostic snapshot.
set helper to a UI source document named "helper.dl" at "file:///workspace/helper.dl" containing "helper means: 21" in project
set client's model to the UI language model for helper in client
set work to the UI language opening in client
free work's payload
set response to a new JSON-RPC array
set work to the UI language reply response at step 4 in client
free response
free work's payload
set response to a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON number "id" is 6, JSON child "result" is (a JSON object containing [JSON child "data" is (a new JSON-RPC array)])]]
set work to the UI language reply response at step 6 in client
free response
invalidate UI source project project
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing helper at 1.0 seconds
require condition ((work's step = 5) and (client's document = main)) reporting "A secondary source bypassed the main diagnostic refresh"
free work's payload
set response to a new JSON-RPC array
set work to the UI language reply response at step 5 in client
free response
free work's payload
set response to a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON number "id" is 6, JSON child "result" is (a JSON object containing [JSON child "data" is (a new JSON-RPC array)])]]
set work to the UI language reply response at step 6 in client
free response
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing helper at 1.0 seconds
require condition ((work's step = 6) and (client's document = helper)) reporting "Unchanged secondary source text was resent instead of refreshing tokens"
require condition (project's reports complete) reporting "A secondary source reset the main diagnostic snapshot"
free work's payload
set response to a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON number "id" is 6, JSON child "result" is (a JSON object containing [JSON child "data" is (a new JSON-RPC array)])]]
set work to the UI language reply response at step 6 in client
free response
require condition ((helper needs UI source analysis) = false) reporting "A secondary source did not finish its new project generation"

free UI language client client
free UI source project project
print line "Project invalidation refreshes diagnostics and rejects stale token replies without changing source text."
